# Scenario-level override that pins GeronimoTransactionManagerProvider
# as a ServiceLoader candidate. GeronimoTransactionManagerProvider's
# @Priority(Integer.MAX_VALUE - 102) is the lowest numeric (= highest
# priority) among the three detail impls, so it wins the priority sort
# against the default AutoSelectTransactionManagerProvider regardless
# of which JTA-impl profile the parent build activated. The scenario's
# own <dependencies> brings geronimo-transaction into the classpath so
# the assertion holds even under `-P jta-narayana`.
org.os890.jawelte.module.jta.impl.adapter.provider.GeronimoTransactionManagerProvider
